  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Allies affected by this instrumental or lyric gain a +3 morale bonus to saving throws against charm and fear effects, increasing by 1 for every 5 ranks in this package’s associated Perform skill you possess.</p>\n<p>When used as an instrumental, if you maintain it on your next turn, all allies within the area gain a +1 morale bonus to attack rolls, +1 per 10 ranks in this package's associated Perform skill you possess.</p>\n<p>When used as an inspiring lyric, the target gains a morale bonus to attack rolls equal to half the bonus granted by the lyric.</p>\n<p>The lyric can be expended as an immediate action to attempt a new saving throw against a single charm or fear effect they are suffering from (as long as the effect allowed a save).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/performance#toc46\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
